    "description": "<p>The Linked Geodesy Research Project topi.link combines geodesy and Linked Data research questions. Using the Academic<br>\nMeta Tool (AMT), we have a little minion, which addresses the task of inferencing vague graph data. topi.link will give<br>\naccess to the AMT world using toponyms as a graph-based vague topology for these toponyms. This paper demonstrates a<br>\nvery simple example how to model a north/south ontology using AMT.</p>",
